  "query_preview": "(Friday through Monday)...\nThat weak low pressure system off the northern Baja coast will\nweaken and move inland on Thursday with drier westerly flow aloft\nfor Friday and Saturday. High pressure aloft over northern Mexico\nand southern Texas will expand westward across Baja during the \nweekend with Hurricane Polo remaining on a west-northwest track \nalong the southern edge of the upper high. \n\nNot much change in high temperatures is expected for Friday and\nSaturday with a low pressure system moving inland across the\nwestern states bringing cooling for Sunday and Monday.",
